# Secluded Courtyard's mana is only for "a creature spell of the chosen type or ... an ability of a creature source of the
# chosen type" (CR 106.6, 602.2b): a Goblin that is no creature gets none. Goblin chosen, its {R} on turn 1, the only mana,
# can't cast Tarfire, a Kindred Instant - Goblin (the refusal). Firdoch Core, a changeling Kindred artifact (every creature
# type, CR 702.73a, but no creature), is cast with Black Lotus. Turn 5 the Courtyard's {R}, the Core's own {R} and the two
# Mountains' make four mana, yet the Core's "{4}: This artifact becomes a 4/4 artifact creature" is not offered: an
# ability of a noncreature source, which the Courtyard's mana can't pay. Eclipsed Realms' scenario is the positive control
# (the same spell and ability paid by mana with no "creature").

